::page[route="/" title="Tours"]

::hero[align=center]
# Paddle the quiet side of Saltmere Harbour
The Harbour Loop Tour takes small groups past the seal rocks and the old lighthouse in three easy hours.
[Book a tour](/contact){primary}
[See prices](/prices)
::

::features[cols=3]
### Small groups
Never more than eight paddlers per guide, so nobody gets left behind.
### All gear included
Every Harbour Loop Tour comes with a kayak, paddle, spray skirt and dry bag.
### Beginner friendly
Our guides teach the basics on the beach before anyone gets wet.
::

::

::page[route="/pricing" title="Pricing"]

# Tours and rentals

Prices are per person and include all safety gear.

::pricing-table
| Option | Price | Includes |
|--------|-------|----------|
| Harbour Loop Tour | $45 | Three hour guided tour |
| Sunset Paddle | $62 | Evening tour with hot drinks |
| Full Day Rental | $80 | Single kayak from nine to five |
::

::faq
### Do I need experience?
No. Most of our guests have never paddled before.
### What should I bring?
Bring water, sunscreen and a change of clothes.
### What if the weather is bad?
We reschedule or refund any tour cancelled for weather.
::

